WEBVTT

00:00:58.846 --> 00:01:01.390
which in turn will improve patient care.

00:01:02.266 --> 00:01:06.687
This is the key to making
our future nurses the stakeholders

00:01:06.687 --> 00:01:09.690
within the future development
of the health care system.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:14.028
So what is innovation?

00:01:14.779 --> 00:01:16.864
It's a bit of an ambiguous word

00:01:16.906 --> 00:01:19.992
that can mean a lot of different things
to many different people.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.871
But simply put, innovation
is looking at a problem,

00:01:23.913 --> 00:01:26.707
understanding it and trying
to make it better.

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:30.503
And if you make it better,
that's innovation.